title: 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_영문
---
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Hey! {name()}.
(I ran into EunPyo in front of the lecture hall.)
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 30 && get("otk") >= 3>>
    <<jump 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_호감도30_덕력3_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_호감도30미만_덕력3미만_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_호감도30_덕력3_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: Hey.
{name()}: Ugh, I really don't feel like being in class today.
{name()}: Want to ditch class with me?
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Hmm. I'd love to. 
EunPyo: Actually, I was thinking about asking you the same thing.
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Are we on the same wavelength?
{name()}: Looks like it.
{name()}: I guess we were destined not to attend class today.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Want to head to the club room?
{name()}: The club room? Sounds good.
EunPyo: There's this game I started playing recently...
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: It's called <B@ng$tar>, and it has so many cute anime girls...
{name()}: Oh? I've heard of that. It's pretty popular these days, right?
{name()}: Should we play it at the club room? I've been wanting to try it.
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Awesome!! I'll show you how to play.
<<bg 낮_동아리방>>
(We moved to the club room.)
(There was no one there.)
(We settled in, unpacked our things, and turned on the computer.)
(EunPyo is downloading <B@ng$tar> with a happy expression.)
{name()}: The character designs in this game are really well done.
{name()}: Who's the best character?
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: For me...
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Guse-go has been my favorite since the previous series.
EunPyo: I've always liked the {get_appearance("인상")} type......
{name()}: So that's your type.
(I've heard people say I have a {get_appearance("인상")} several times before...)
(Am I just overthinking it?)
(We both logged into <B@ng$tar>.)
{name()}: Tell me your nickname, I'll add you as a friend.
EunPyo: Mine is... 'Sego-Sego-Pyo-Jjang.'
{name()}: Oh... that's quite a name.
<<show pyo_neg2>>
EunPyo: Hey! Look who's talking. What's yours?
{name()}: I haven't made one yet.
{name()}: Want to pick one for me?
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Hmm...
(EunPyo had a playful look on her face.)
<<choice 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_닉네임1_영문 "Sure, why not." 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_닉네임2_영문 "That's a bit much...">>
EunPyo: Let's match. Go with '{name()}{name()}-Jjang.'
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_닉네임1_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: Sure, why not.
{name()}: Matching couple nicknames, nice.
<<play 서은표_흠>>
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: 'Couple'... you're making me blush...
<<jump 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_게임끝_영문>>
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_닉네임2_영문
---
<<dislike 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo -5>>
{name()}: That's a bit much, don't you think?
<<show pyo_neg2>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Well... if you don't like it, fine...
{name()}: Hmm.
(I couldn't think of a better name anyway,)
(And looking at her, EunPyo's lips are pouting like crazy.)
(I set my name to {name()}{name()}-Jjang and sent a friend request to EunPyo.)
{name()}: I sent the request. I just went with what you said.
EunPyo: Oh, wait a second...
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Wait, what! You actually did what I told you?
{name()}: Might as well match since we're playing together.
<<jump 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_게임끝_영문>>
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_게임끝_영문
---
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Let's play in co-op mode.
<<play 공통_키보드>>
(We played <B@ng$tar> together.)
(Compared to me, a total beginner, EunPyo was a pro.)
(I kept losing hearts and was about to get eliminated, but EunPyo hard-carried me and kept me alive.)
{name()}: This is harder than it looks...
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Hmm... maybe it's because the settings aren't right? Let me make it a bit more comfortable for you.
{name()}: Okay.
(Just as I was about to hand the mouse over to EunPyo,)
(She leaned toward me, and we became noticeably close.)
(Because I froze, my hand on the mouse and EunPyo's hand reaching for it overlapped.)
(She definitely touched my hand.)
<<show pyo_shock>>
<<play 서은표_허>>
EunPyo: Oh...
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: S-sorry!!
(After a moment of silence, EunPyo quickly pulled her hand away.)
{name()}: No, it's fine.
(EunPyo's face turned noticeably red.)
EunPyo: Oh man...
EunPyo: ...Give me the mouse, and I'll adjust the settings...
(I handed the mouse to EunPyo.)
(After finishing the settings, EunPyo fanned her face with her hand.)
(We spent the rest of the time enjoying the game.)
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Let's play again sometime. It's way more fun playing together.
EunPyo: I have to head to my next class now... See ya.
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_호감도30미만_덕력3미만_영문
---
EunPyo: I really don't feel like being in class today.
{name()}: Me neither. I'm especially tired today.
{name()}: Should I skip...
<<show pyo_neg2>>
EunPyo: Oh, but do you know there's an assignment due by the end of today's class?
{name()}: ...Wait, what?!
{name()}: Seriously??!??
{name()}: I had no idea.
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: What? I'm so glad I mentioned it just in case.
EunPyo: Hurry up and do it now.
EunPyo: I'm not exactly an expert, but... I'll help as much as I can.
{name()}: Yeah... thanks for letting me know.
{name()}: I might have actually had to retake this course if it weren't for you.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Don't mention it. Hurry up and open your laptop.
(I sat down, opened my laptop, and opened the assignment PDF.)
<<choice 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_과제2_긍_영문 "This is harder than I thought... how do I do this?" 주2_화_3교시_강의실_서은표_과제2_부정_영문 "Let me try it on my own first.">>
